[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=软件源优选（国内/国际镜像）
Name[en]=Software Mirror Selector
Comment=测试国内与官方/国际镜像延迟并自动切换最优节点
Comment[en]=Test latency of domestic and international mirrors and switch to the fastest
Exec=konsole -e sudo tinyos-mirror
Icon=system-software-update
Terminal=false
Categories=System;Settings;X-TinyOS;
Keywords=mirror;apt;源;镜像;更新;
